## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0672, std = 0.1459, ICIR = 0.46, HAC t-stat = 7.6 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0766, std = 0.1401, IR = 0.55, HAC t-stat = 9.2 (lags=5)
