- 2021-02-09: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.034, entropy=1.000
- 2021-09-28: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.034, entropy=1.000
- 2022-12-30: diag_mass=0.006, top5_mass=0.034, entropy=1.000

